QuestGuidance.Register("en",257,{
[8193]="70048B10\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\tSoot-smudged pages can be found scattered around Udûn. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n3\tTalk to Narthavron\tNarthavron can be found at the Udûn Foothold. You should talk to Narthavron.\n",
[8194]="70050266\n1\tCollect page 1\030Collect page 2\030Collect page 3\030Collect page 4\030Collect page 5\030Collect page 6\030Collect page 7\030Collect page 8\tFrozen pages can be found scattered around Ered Mithrin. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8195]="70050265\n1\tCollect page 1\030Collect page 2\030Collect page 3\030Collect page 4\030Collect page 5\030Collect page 6\030Collect page 7\030Collect page 8\030Collect page 9\030Collect page 10\tRusted pages can be found scattered around the Ironfold. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8196]="70050267\n1\tRecord writing 1\030Record writing 2\030Record writing 3\030Record writing 4\030Record writing 5\030Record writing 6\030Record writing 7\030Record writing 8\030Record writing 9\030Record writing 10\030Record writing 11\tClaw-mark writing can be found scattered around Glimmerdeep and Stormwall. You should record the writing to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8197]="7004E9E3\n1\tFind the first page\030Find the second page\030Find the third page\030Find the fourth page\030Find the fifth page\030Find the sixth page\030Find the seventh page\030Find the eighth page\030Find the ninth page\030Find the tenth page\030Find the eleventh page\030Find the twelfth page\030Find the thirteenth page\030Find the fourteenth page\tRust-stained writing can be found in Thikil-gundu and among the Ered Mithrin. You should find more rust-stained pages to learn more of the lost lore of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have gathered all the pages of the lost lore of Thikil-gundu, the Steel Keep.\n",
[8198]="70054D0D\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\030Collect Page 17\030Collect Page 18\030Collect Page 19\030Collect Page 20\030Collect Page 21\030Collect Page 22\030Collect Page 23\030Collect Page 24\030Collect Page 25\030Collect Page 26\030Collect Page 27\tStark-white pages can be found scattered throughout Mordor Besieged. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n3\tContinue adventuring in Mordor Besieged\tYou have found lost pages of a journal authored by Elendil. You should continue adventuring in Mordor Besieged.\n4\tTalk to Elendil\tHigh King Elendil can be found in Adambel. If he is missing, he will return after the Council of the Kings.\n",
[8199]="70054D0C\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\030Collect Page 17\030Collect Page 18\030Collect Page 19\tAncient pages can be found scattered throughout Cirith Ungol. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n3\tContinue Adventuring in Cirith Ungol\tLegolas still needs your help in Cirith Ungol searching for Shelob. You should continue adventuring in Cirith Ungol.\n4\tTalk to Celeborn\tCeleborn can be found outside Torech Ungol, at the top of the Winding Stair. You should talk to Celeborn.\n",
[8200]="70054D0A\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\030Collect Page 17\030Collect Page 18\030Collect Page 19\tGlowing Pages can be found in Minas Morgul. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8201]="70054D0B\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\030Collect Page 17\030Collect Page 18\tRune-inscribed Pages can be found scattered throughout Thuringwath. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8202]="7004D8BA\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\030Collect Page 17\tDusty pages can be found scattered around the Dale-lands. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8203]="7004D8D0\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\030Collect Page 17\tBark-paper pages can be found scattered around Eryn Lasgalen. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8204]="7004D8C0\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\tSoggy pages can be found scattered around the Dale-lands. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8205]="70053055\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\tBirch-bark pages can be found scattered throughout the Vales of Anduin. You should collect the pages to complete the song.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8206]="7005335D\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\tOld-elven parchments can be found scattered throughout the Vales of Anduin. You should collect the pages to complete the song.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8207]="70027295\n1\tTalk to Inir\tInir awaits rescue in the Barnavon Mine. You should escort Inir to the mine entrance.\n2\tTalk to Cada at the mine\tCada is outside the Barnavon Mine. You should return to Cada with news of Inir's rescue.\n",
[8208]="70027297\n1\tTalk to Siam\tSiam is awaiting rescue in the Barnavon Mine. You should escort Siam to the mine entrance.\n2\tTalk to Cada at the mine\tCada is outside the Barnavon Mine. You should return to Cada and let him know that Siam is safe.\n",
[8209]="70027296\n1\tTalk to Wilim\tWilim awaits rescue in the Barnavon Mine. You should escort Wilim to the mine entrance.\n2\tTalk to Cada at the mine\tCada is outside the Barnavon Mine. You should return to Cada and let him know that you escorted Wilim to freedom.\n",
[8210]="70027204\n1\tTalk to Gwilum in Barnavon\tGwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine. Cada asked you to bring the good news of Wilim's survival to Gwilum.\n",
[8211]="70027205\n1\tTalk to Gwilum in Barnavon\tGwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine. Cada has asked you to bring the good tidings of Siam's survival to Gwilum.\n",
[8212]="70027206\n1\tTalk to Gwilum in Barnavon\tGwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine. Cada asked you to take the good tidings of Inir's survival to Gwilum.\n",
[8213]="7000ED9B\n1\tBring the marbles to Warstang\030Collect marbles (total: 10)\tYou may find the beasts that ate Warstang's marbles scattered throughout Länsi-mâ. Find Warstang's lost marbles in the bellies of the beasts who ate them and return them to him at the dwarf-outpost of Zigilgund.\n",
[8214]="70066AE4\n1\tFind Corsair captives at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor\tHedra has asked you to free Corsair captives at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor, if there are any. You should first find them.\n2\tTalk to the Corsair captive\tYou have found a Corsair captive at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor. You should talk to him.\n3\tFree Udnerth from his bindings\tYou have found the last surviving Corsair captive at the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor. You should free Udnerth from his bindings.\n4\tTalk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor\tYou've done what you set out to do. You should talk to Udnerth outside of the wreck of the Kêl Tezhor.\n",
[8215]="70045450\n1\tSpeak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât\tRhûd-pulo-Drât can be found in Nardol Quarry. You should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.\n2\tSpeak with Ghân-buri-Ghân\tGhân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.\n",
[8216]="70015468\n1\tCollect supply-crates (total: 6)\tThe goblin-thieves were last seen fleeing north along the road towards Mudmulzarâk. Gansi has asked you to recover the stolen supply-crates from the goblins who took them.\n2\tBring the supply-crates to Gansi\030Collect Supply-crate (total: 6)\tGansi is at the Chamber of the Crossroads, south of Mudmulzarâk. You have collected the supply crates stolen by the goblins and should bring them at once to Gansi.\n",
[8217]="7006B674\n1\tDefeat bandits (total: 6)\030Recover stolen trade-goods (total: 4)\tThe bandits attacked the waggon along the Road of Riches to the east of Iridír. You should defeat the bandits in that area and recover the lost trade-goods.\n2\tReturn to Dashên with the recovered trade-goods\tYou have defeated the bandits and recovered the stolen trade-goods. You should return to Iridír and speak to Dashên.\n",
[8218]="7006138C\n1\tFree Reginard from his bindings\tYou should free Reginard from his bindings.\n2\tFind Reginard's pack\tReginard has asked you to find his pack, which must be somewhere in Lhúngobel.\n3\tRetrieve Reginard's pack\tYou have found Reginard's pack with most of its contents ruined. You should retrieve his pack for him.\n4\tTalk to Reginard outside of Lhúngobel\tReginard is waiting for you outside of Lhúngobel. You should return to him with his pack and what remains of his belongings.\n5\tReturn to Reginard's camp-site in the marsh\tReginard has invited you to meet up with him back at his camp-site. His camp-site is in the marsh south of Lhúngobel.\n6\tTalk to Reginard\tYou have found Reginard back at his camp-site. You should talk to him.\n",
[8219]="7006BB29\n1\tSearch for Edâkhi near the Falls of Ilûritu\tKiga has asked you to search for the leader of her group, Edâkhi, near the Falls of Ilûritu.\n2\tSpeak with Edâkhi\tSpeak to Edâkhi and tell her that Kiga is worried about her.\n3\tReturn to Kiga in Ub Nishir\tReturn to Kiga in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and let her know about Edâkhi.\n",
[8220]="70058FDC\n1\tCollect dwarf-make weapons lost in the War of Three Peaks (total: 15)\tDwarf-make weapons can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks. You have discovered a number of dwarf-make weapons lost in the fighting during the War of Three Peaks. You should collect them for the Gabil'akkâ.\n2\tDeliver the dwarf-make weapons to Lági Helmbiter\tLági Helmbiter can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. You have recovered many dwarf-make weapons lost during the War of Three Peaks. You should deliver them to Lági Helmbiter.\n",
[8221]="70062B31\n1\tSearch for signs of Mellanion\tGrethron believes that Annaethel's son may yet live. You should look for signs of Mellanion in Caranost, in central Cardolan.\n2\tContinue to look for signs of Mellanion\tThe blanket you found is definitely of Elven weave. Could it have belonged to the missing Elf-child? You should continue to look for signs of Mellanion in Caranost, in central Cardolan.\n3\tContinue looking for signs of Mellanion\tThe hobby horse looks like it's been chewed on, but hopefully its owner has not been! Keep looking for signs of Mellanion in Caranost, in central Cardolan.\n4\tIgnite the black powder crate\tMellanion managed to hide from his captors, but he needs help making his escape. He wants you to ignite the crate of black powder he spotted in the tower above the stairs. The tower is in Caranost.\n5\tReturn to Sírlond\tWith the Orcs distracted, Mellanion was able to make his escape! You should check to be sure he made it back to Sírlond. Sírlond is in central Cardolan.\n6\tGive the hobby horse to Mellanion\tGrethron wants you to give the hobby horse back to Mellanion. Mellanion is in Sírlond, thanks to you.\n",
[8222]="700300F6\n1\tObserve Baillas's memory\tThe Ent Baillas can be found towards the central southern edge of Fangorn Forest. You should speak with Baillas to learn the memory upon which he dwells.\n2\tTalk to Baillas once more\tThe Ent Baillas can be found towards the central southern edge of Fangorn Forest. You should speak with Baillas.\n",
[8223]="70000704\n1\tBring the Orc orders to Saeradan\tSaeradan is at the Ranger cabin along the Greenway, north of Bree and east of the road, near Thornley's Work Site. Candaith gave you both sets of orders you collected and asked you to show them to the Ranger Saeradan.\n2\tReturn the Orc orders to Candaith\tThe Ranger Candaith is at his camp at the foot of Weathertop. Saeradan revealed that Orcs calling themselves Uruk-hai have come north to spy out the land and discover why their northern cousins are moving southward. He asked you to return quickly to Candaith and warn him of the danger.\n",
[8224]="7004A8EA\n1\tNurnhoth can be found in Dath Nethryn. A Nurnhoth has asked you to find his companions, who have become lost and endangered in the swamps of Dath Nethryn.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have aided many of the Nurnhoth lost and endangered in the shallows of Dath Nethryn.\n",
})
